{"id":"vod_sn_35537","vodId":"35537","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"八月的棒球甜心","name_cn":"八月的棒球甜心","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/2a985e8224b994e7dd2d1b7a2725a914.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在市立里滨高中内，有原翼（西田望见 配音）是刚刚升上高中的校园新鲜人，曾经，身为棒球队队长的她对甲子园怀揣着无尽的希冀，但一场意外让她在心灰意冷之中放弃了梦想。如今的高中是一个没有棒球部的学校，虽然暗地里松了一口气，但有原翼同时还感到了小小的失望，难道棒球真的是她无法割舍的梦想吗？　　出生于棒球世家的傲娇大小姐东云龙（近藤玲奈 配音）、拥有魔鬼身材，个性温柔非常会照顾人的野崎夕姬（南早纪 配音）、个性活泼开朗的天然呆河北智惠（井上穗乃花 配音），在学校里，有原翼结识了这些对棒球充满了热情和兴趣的女孩子们。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:35:36","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DtqMKy3Aqv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ucnyMrCq2g1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/te8wEMasA41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/w6AZsEa47g1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iYVZ8Rk2nj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DqTYJzzTLt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rNHaFXJjUt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/C6B2q4QEgY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wnncwW7Uh81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/phT4DBzkpM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ASmwJ5m6y01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/W1xYATz9tn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DgxDqypeze1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:33.913Z"}